=== basic multiline
# This is just a simple one key hash.
--- yaml
a: |
   ciao
   a tutti
--- json
{"a":"ciao\na tutti\n"}

=== multiline with inner indentation
# This is just a simple one key hash.
--- yaml
a: |
   ciao
         a
   tutti
--- json
{"a":"ciao\n      a\ntutti\n"}

=== two multilines with variable inner indentation
# This is just a simple one key hash.
--- yaml
- |
   ciao
         a
      tutti
- |
      quanti
         voi
      amici
--- json
["ciao\n      a\n   tutti\n","quanti\n   voi\namici\n"]

=== basic folded block
# Folded blocks join lines with spaces.
--- yaml
a: >
   ciao
   a tutti
--- json
{"a":"ciao a tutti\n"}

=== folded block with inner indentation
# In folded blocks, lines with extra indentation (beyond the established indent)
# preserve their relative spacing when folded.
--- yaml
a: >
   ciao
         a
   tutti
--- json
{"a":"ciao       a tutti\n"}

=== literal block with strip chomp
# The strip chomp modifier (-) removes the trailing newline.
--- yaml
a: |-
   ciao
         a
   tutti
--- json
{"a":"ciao\n      a\ntutti"}

